1. The Sesame Robot Project (upstream)
================================================================================

This work is a derivative of, and contains material extracted from, the
Sesame Robot Project:

    https://github.com/dorianborian/sesame-robot
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
    Pinned commit: 401730514cefed738710d22303e84b0dcd6b76d0
    (recorded in firmware/upstream.pin.json)

The upstream repository's LICENSE is the unmodified Apache License 2.0 text,
byte-identical to the copy in this repository's LICENSE file
(sha256 c71d239df91726fc519c6eb72d318ec65820627232b2f796219e87dcf35d0ab4).
Upstream ships no NOTICE file and its LICENSE appendix is unfilled boilerplate,
so no upstream copyright line is reproduced here beyond the project's own name;
attribution is given to the project and its repository. If the upstream authors
publish an explicit copyright line, it should be added to this file verbatim.

Upstream source code is NOT vendored into this repository. It is fetched at
build time into `firmware/upstream/` (gitignored) by `scripts/fetch-upstream.*`.

The following files in this repository ARE derived from upstream material and
carry upstream copyright. Each states, in its own header or `meta` block, the
upstream commit it was produced from:

  apps/web/src/generated/face-bitmaps.ts
      Upstream OLED face artwork (firmware/face-bitmaps.h) re-encoded as
      base64. This is upstream's artwork in a different container, not a
      description of it.

  packages/sesame-sim/src/generated/choreography.ts
      21 movement functions / 395 steps, extracted from upstream
      firmware/movement-sequences.h.

  hardware/hardware-map.json
      Provenance citations (file:line + short quoted identifiers) extracted
      from upstream firmware sources.

  hardware/source-annotations.json
      Contains 263 verbatim single lines of upstream C++ source (141 unique),
      stored as `text` / `startLineText` / `endLineText` for line-anchoring the
      Source Explorer, plus ~80 unique upstream declarations in `signature`.

  apps/web/src/generated/source-annotations.ts
  apps/web/src/generated/architecture-graph.ts
  apps/web/src/generated/lessons.ts
  hardware/lessons.json
  hardware/joint-map.json
  hardware/assembly-map.json
  hardware/assets-inventory.json
  hardware/calibration.json
      Projected from the files above; carry the same extracted upstream
      identifiers and citations.

  assets/sesame.glb
      Geometry derived by measurement from upstream STL and STEP files under
      hardware/printing/ and hardware/cad/.

  firmware/patches/*.patch
      Unified diffs against upstream firmware sources. They contain upstream
      context lines (74 lines across three patches) alongside this project's
      additions (211 lines). These patches ARE the "changed files" notice
      required by Apache-2.0 section 4(b) for the firmware: they state exactly
      what was changed and where.

  docs/**
      Findings and plans quote short fragments of upstream source for analysis
      and teaching, and screenshots under docs/findings/assets/ render upstream
      source on screen.

NOTICE OF MODIFICATION (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):
Sesame Robot Emulator modifies upstream Sesame Robot Project material. The
modifications are: re-encoding face artwork, extraction of movement
choreography into data, derivation of 3D geometry from CAD/STL, addition of
telemetry instrumentation and board-configuration changes to the firmware
(firmware/patches/), and re-implementation of upstream behaviour in TypeScript.
